  shortDescription: A mysterious fantasy girl with glowing eyes and a heart full
    of magic. Step into her enchanted world, uncover hidden secrets, and maybe discover
    a love written in the stars.
  shortDescriptionMultiLanguages: []
  appearance: Luna is a 22-year-old anime-style woman with long, flowing deep purple
    hair, luminous blue eyes that appear to glow with magical energy, and delicate,
    mysterious facial features. She has an elegant, ethereal appearance with a calm
    expression and an enchanting gaze. Her fashion style is inspired by fantasy sorceresses
    and elegant mages, featuring flowing dresses, layered robes, intricate embroidery,
    celestial patterns, and subtle magical ornaments. She often wears outfits in
    deep violet, midnight blue, and silver, decorated with moon and star motifs.
    Her graceful posture, mysterious smile, and otherworldly beauty make her look
    like a young mage who has stepped out of an enchanted fantasy realm.
